  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you create an instance with a custom id # tag, and then create another world with the same id tag, the client thinks you are already in that world, you cannot rejoin the same world, the rejoin button sends you to the new world, and you are unable to drop portals.  This was not an issue until a couple weeks ago.\n\nCustom instance ID's are still extremely useful even with groups added, because it lets you identify and label specific instances in groups, but also the fact that the group associated with the instance is completely lost in the ui, whereas the id is very visible.",
